    {
     "id": "t1",
     "text": "Keeping agents in the cage. Three fences, and one door that only you open."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "sandbox",
   "kind": "shot",
   "heading": "The sandbox",
   "shot": "create",
   "lines": [
    {
     "id": "s1",
     "text": "An agent runs as you, with your files and your keys. Do not let it feel too at home."
    },
    {
     "id": "s2",
     "text": "So when you create a session, leave Filesystem sandbox switched on."
    },
    {
     "id": "s3",
     "text": "Its commands cannot read Eggify's own secrets, and they write only in the workspace and temporary folders."
    },
    {
     "id": "s4",
     "text": "It is fixed for that session. The Permissions row says Sandboxed, or Not sandboxed."
    }
   ],
