   "id": "trust",
   "kind": "shot",
   "heading": "Workspace trust",
   "shot": "trust",
   "lines": [
    {
     "id": "w1",
     "text": "A project folder can carry its own hooks, tools and servers."
    },
    {
     "id": "w2",
     "text": "Until you trust it, Eggify does not load them, and the chat says so."
    },
    {
     "id": "w3",
     "text": "Press Review to see every command and server it would start."
    },
    {
     "id": "w4",
     "text": "If those files change later, Eggify stops loading them and asks again."
    },
    {
     "id": "w5",
     "text": "Trust folder is your decision, so read the list first."
    }
   ],
