   "heading": "The review queue",
   "shot": "memories",
   "lines": [
    {
     "id": "r1",
     "text": "A memory that an agent writes waits for your approval before anything uses it."
    },
    {
     "id": "r2",
     "text": "No session uses them until you approve, and you read them as text from a stranger."
    },
    {
     "id": "r3",
     "text": "A skill found on disk waits in the same queue."
    },
    {
     "id": "r4",
     "text": "The review lists the hook it would run, the tools it may use unasked, and each file, scripts marked executable."
    },
    {
     "id": "r5",
     "text": "Then Approve, Edit and Approve, or Reject."
    }
   ],
